 minigame, what a session costs, the exhausted rule, the slot machine's
 payouts and the brains marks are MOD_TRAIN_GAIN / MOD_TRAIN_RULES (first gym
 set) and MOD_TRAIN2_GAIN / MOD_TRAIN2_RULES (second set); the second set's
 multiplier, which was hardcoded and ignored training.json, reads its own
 MOD_TRAIN2_NUM / LEVEL / BONUS (training.json training2)

